    {
      "role": "user",
      "content": "i hear you about being consistent but i'm really motivated to do a serious detox/cleanse style thing with these greens for a few weeks to reset my system. i'm thinking like maybe a giant bowl of spinach and kale every single meal for the next two weeks just to really flood my body with the good stuff. surely my body can handle a big boost like that once in a while, right? it's just plant matter after all.",
